 "body_html": "<section class=\"sec tm-sec\"><div class=\"wrap tm-narrow tm-prose\"><p class=\"tm-lead\">At W Employment Law , we are committed to being honest and fair with our clients. If we are unable to take on your case, we will be direct or may refer you to another attorney who can help.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"margin-top:34px\"><div class=\"tm-cards\"><div class=\"tm-card\"><h3>Client-First Approach</h3><p>Our firm regards being responsive to our clients’ concerns and acting upon them promptly as its priority.</p></div><div class=\"tm-card\"><h3>Full Service Employment Lawyers</h3><p>Our firm regards being responsive to our clients’ concerns and acting upon them promptly as its priority.</p></div><div class=\"tm-card\"><h3>No Fee Unless We Win</h3><p>Our firm regards being responsive to our clients’ concerns and acting upon them promptly as its priority.</p></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec tm-sec tm-pt0\"><div class=\"wrap tm-split tm-top\">\n  <figure class=\"tm-fig\"><img src=\"{{IMG}}img/old/pricing-2-min-scaled.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></figure>\n  <div class=\"tm-prose\"><p>We understand that most employees who are victims of wrongful termination, harassment, discrimination, or wage and hour issues may be unable to pay an upfront or hourly rate for an attornies help as they may be out of a job or may not have the funds. It is for this reason that we take our cases on a contingency basis.</p><p>This means that you do not pay anything upfront and we front all the fees and costs. Additionally, we do not get paid unless we win the case for you. You don’t pay anything out of pocket, and we take a percentage out of the settlement or court award against the employer. If we do not win, you will not owe anything. We are driven to work hard to give you the compensation you deserve, and we are ready to take on all the risks possible.</p><p>Along with attorney time, there are costs associated with litigation, including filing fees, process serving fees, deposition costs, court reporter costs, mediation or arbitration fees, and other court-related costs. Rather than overwhelming you with the costs upfront, in most cases we advance the costs and reimburse ourselves for what we advanced after winning your case. Once more, if we do not win your case, you will owe nothing.</p><p>Not sure if you need an employment lawyer? Talk to us for free today and tell us your story. We’ll let you know if we can help with your employment issue, or refer you to someone who can.</p></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec tm-sec tm-soft\"><div class=\"wrap tm-formwrap\">\n  <h2 class=\"tm-h2 tm-center\">Have Your Case Reviewed For Free</h2>\n  <div class=\"form-card tm-formcard tm-bigform\">\n      <form id=\"caseForm\" data-hs-form=\"460ba517-6b2d-47cc-9f1d-379c4bd53ee4\">\n        <div class=\"fc-row\">\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">First name <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"f_first\" required autocomplete=\"given-name\"></label>\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">Last name <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"f_last\" required autocomplete=\"family-name\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fc-row\">\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">Email <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"f_email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">Phone number <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"f_phone\" type=\"tel\" required autocomplete=\"tel\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"tm-fl\">Preferred Method of Contact (email/call/text) and Preferred Time <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"p_pref\" required></label>\n        <fieldset class=\"tm-cg\" data-cg=\"p_employer\"><legend>My employer... <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></legend><div class=\"tm-cg-opts\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Fired me\"> <span>Fired me</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Demoted me\"> <span>Demoted me</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Denied my promotion\"> <span>Denied my promotion</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Cut my hours\"> <span>Cut my hours</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Harassed me\"> <span>Harassed me</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Retaliated against me\"> <span>Retaliated against me</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Denied accommodations for my disability or medical issue\"> <span>Denied accommodations for my disability or medical issue</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Transferred me to an inferior position\"> <span>Transferred me to an inferior position</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Refused to let me return from leave to the same position\"> <span>Refused to let me return from leave to the same position</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_employer\" value=\"Other\"> <span>Other</span></label></div></fieldset>\n        <fieldset class=\"tm-cg\" data-cg=\"p_because\"><legend>I was treated wrongfully because of my... <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></legend><div class=\"tm-cg-opts\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Race\"> <span>Race</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Age\"> <span>Age</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Gender/Sex\"> <span>Gender/Sex</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Sexual Orientation\"> <span>Sexual Orientation</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Pregnancy\"> <span>Pregnancy</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Disability\"> <span>Disability</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Request for FMLA or CFRA\"> <span>Request for FMLA or CFRA</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Complaints\"> <span>Complaints</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Religion\"> <span>Religion</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Marital Status\"> <span>Marital Status</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Ethnicity\"> <span>Ethnicity</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Gender Identity\"> <span>Gender Identity</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Military Status\"> <span>Military Status</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p_because\" value=\"Whistleblowing\"> <span>Whistleblowing</span></label></div></fieldset>\n        <label class=\"tm-fl\">Brief description of your employment issue: <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><textarea class=\"field\" id=\"p_desc\" rows=\"4\" required></textarea></label>\n        <div class=\"fc-row\">\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">I was fired on.. <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"p_fired\" required></label>\n          <label class=\"tm-fl\">Approximate number of employees at workplace: <span class=\"tm-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span><input class=\"field\" id=\"p_size\" required></label>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"tm-fl\">County Worked In<select class=\"field\" id=\"p_county\"><option value=\"\"></option><option>Orange County</option><option>Los Angeles County</option><option>San Diego County</option><option>Ventura County</option><option>San Bernardino County</option><option>Other</option></select></label>\n        <textarea id=\"f_msg\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"></textarea>\n        <input id=\"f_co\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-gold\" type=\"submit\" id=\"f_btn\">Submit</button>\n        <p class=\"fine\" id=\"f_note\"></p>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"badges-band tm-badges\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"badges-row\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/aaj-member.webp\" alt=\"American Association for Justice — Member\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/top40-under40.webp\" alt=\"Premier Lawyers Top 40 Under 40 of America 2020\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/avvo-rating-10.webp\" alt=\"Avvo Rating 10.0 — Jacob N Whitehead, Top Attorney\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/expertise-best-2021.webp\" alt=\"Expertise.com — Best Employment Lawyers in Irvine 2021\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/americas-top-100.webp\" alt=\"America&#x27;s Top 100 High Stakes Litigators\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/multi-million-dollar-advocates.webp\" alt=\"Multi-Million Dollar Advocates Forum\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/avvo-clients-choice.webp\" alt=\"Avvo Clients&#x27; Choice Award 2021 — Jacob N Whitehead\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <img src=\"{{IMG}}img/super-lawyers-rising-stars.webp\" alt=\"Super Lawyers Rising Stars — Jacob Whitehead\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n<script>\n/* Pricing form: same fields as the old page's form. Required checkbox groups are validated here,\n   then every answer is folded into the HubSpot \"message\" field before the shared\n   #caseForm handler (registered later, in the site footer script) posts it. */\n(function(){\n  var form=document.getElementById('caseForm'); if(!form) return;\n  form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){\n    var bad=null;\n    form.querySelectorAll('.tm-cg').forEach(function(g){\n      var ok=g.querySelector('input:checked'); g.classList.toggle('tm-err',!ok); if(!ok&&!bad) bad=g;\n    });\n    if(bad){ e.preventDefault(); e.stopImmediatePropagation(); bad.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});\n      document.getElementById('f_note').textContent='Please complete the required fields.'; return; }\n    function v(id){var el=document.getElementById(id);return el?el.value.trim():'';}\n    function c(n){return Array.prototype.map.call(form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked'),function(i){return i.value;}).join(', ');}\n    document.getElementById('f_msg').value=\n      'Preferred Method of Contact (email/call/text) and Preferred Time: '+v('p_pref')+'\\n'+\n      'My employer...: '+c('p_employer')+'\\n'+\n      'I was treated wrongfully because of my...: '+c('p_because')+'\\n'+\n      'Brief description of your employment issue: '+v('p_desc')+'\\n'+\n      'I was fired on..: '+v('p_fired')+'\\n'+\n      'Approximate number of employees at workplace: '+v('p_size')+'\\n'+\n      'County Worked In: '+v('p_county')+'\\n'+\n      '[Submitted from the Pricing page form]';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n"
}